senyorials i racons plens de llegendes. Sent el pols d&#8217;una ciutat que respira hist\u00f2ria en cada pedra. <\/span><\/p><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Qu\u00e8 descobrir\u00e0s en aquest tour?<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">La imponent <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Pla\u00e7a des Born<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, centre neur\u00e0lgic de la ciutat i testimoni de la seva hist\u00f2ria.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Els exteriors de l&#8217;<\/span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Ajuntament<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, l&#8217;elegant <\/span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Teatre des Born<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\"> i els palaus que l&#8217;envolten.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">L&#8217;encant del <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">port natural de Ciutadella<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, amb les seves barques tradicionals i el seu ambient mariner.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Les majestuoses naus de la <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Catedral-Bas\u00edlica de Santa Maria de Menorca<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, joia del g\u00f2tic catal\u00e0.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Els secrets del <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Monestir de Santa Clara<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> i les hist\u00f2ries que guarden els seus murs.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">An\u00e8cdotes i curiositats locals que nom\u00e9s una guia de l&#8217;illa et pot explicar.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Idiomes:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Castell\u00e0, angl\u00e8s i franc\u00e8s. <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Durada:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> 2 hores.<\/span><\/p><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Inclou:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Recorregut a peu amb una guia oficial acreditada.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Explicacions hist\u00f2riques i culturals detallades.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">No inclou:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Entrades a monuments que requereixin tiquet (opcional).<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Transport fins al punt de trobada.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Propines.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Pol\u00edtica de Cancel\u00b7laci\u00f3<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">En reservar, acceptes les seg\u00fcents condicions:<\/span><\/p><ul><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancel\u00b7laci\u00f3 gratu\u00efta:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Podr\u00e0s cancel\u00b7lar sense cap cost fins a <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">24 hores<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">  abans de l&#8217;hora d&#8217;inici del tour. Se&#8217;t reemborsar\u00e0 el 100% de l&#8217;import. <\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancel\u00b7lacions tardanes o no presentaci\u00f3:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Si cancel\u00b7les amb menys de 24 hores d&#8217;antelaci\u00f3 o no et presentes al punt de trobada a l&#8217;hora acordada, no es realitzar\u00e0 cap reemborsament.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancel\u00b7laci\u00f3 per part del guia:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">  El tour podr\u00e0 ser canc